*   **Semiconductors:** As $T \uparrow$, more electron-hole pairs are created, causing **Carrier Density ($n$) $\uparrow$**. Even though $\tau$ decreases, the increase in $n$ dominates. Result: **Resistance $\downarrow$ as $T \uparrow$**.

