### Brightness Rules
*   **The Golden Rule:** Brightness depends on the **Actual Power Consumed** in the circuit, not the number printed on the bulb.
*   **In Parallel (Standard Home Wiring):** The bulb with **higher rated wattage** (lower resistance) consumes more power and glows **brighter**.
*   **In Series:** The bulb with **lower rated wattage** (higher resistance) consumes more power ($I^2R$) and glows **brighter**.

